# UI (Atrium)

`docs/atrium-style-guide.md` is the full contract; mockups are `docs/atrium/mockups/{desktop/dNN,mobile/mNN}-*-{light,dark}.html` (see `INDEX.md`). Read a mockup or guide section only when the task names it.

## Reference pages (copy, don't design from scratch)
- List: `src/app/(app)/clients/clients-table.tsx` (d04, m05)
- Form: `src/app/(app)/clients/client-form-dialog.tsx` (d26, m27)
- Dashboard/KPIs/charts: `src/app/(app)/dashboard/dashboard-view.tsx`, `dashboard-charts.tsx` (d02, m02)
- Delete: `src/components/delete-confirm-dialog.tsx` + `slide-to-delete.tsx` (d27, m28, m29)
- Signed-out: `src/app/login/*` (d01, m01); module launcher: `src/app/(app)/modules/modules-grid.tsx` (m03)

## Layout and shell
- Calm layouts: one primary action, generous spacing, hairlines not nested boxes, Title Case.
- Mobile-first; `sm:`–`xl:` only add. Shell switches at `md:`. No `max-sm:`/`max-md:`/`max-lg:` undo variants.
- Pages in `src/app/(app)/` render inside `AppShell`; content starts with one `PageHeader`. No second sidebar/header/tab bar. New destinations: `navItems` (`src/lib/access.ts`) + lucide icon in `navIcons` (`src/lib/nav-icons.ts`); never dots or initials. Signed-out UI stays on `AuthStage`.

## Components
- Use: `PageHeader`, `SectionHeader`, `Card`/`Panel`, `Money`, `StatusBadge`, `Badge`, `DataList` (+`mobileItem`), `ListSearch`, `CustomizeColumns`, `ListExport`, `FieldGroup layout="inset"`/`Field`, `Select` (`capsule`), `Combobox`, `Dialog`, `DeleteConfirmDialog`, `Tabs`, `Empty`, `Skeleton`, `sonner`.
- Primitives in `src/components/ui` (shadcn base-nova); extend with a variant there, never fork or hand-write lookalikes. No inline visual `style` or `<style>` tags.

## Color, type, radius
- No hardcoded colors (hex/rgb/hsl/oklch, palette or arbitrary color classes, incl. SVG/chart props). Only Atrium tokens from `globals.css`; glass via `glass-*`/`tile-sheen`/`shadow-*`. Token opacity ok. No `dark:` overrides. Don't change `globals.css` for one screen.
- Type tokens (`text-page-title`…`text-micro`), weights `font-book|label|strong|semibold|bold`, radius tokens (`rounded-control`…`rounded-sheet`). Arbitrary sizes last resort.

## Mobile and interaction
- Phone lists are `DataList` cards; dialogs are bottom sheets (see `form-dialog.mdc`). Touch targets ≥44px (no `xs`/`sm`/`icon-xs`/`icon-sm` buttons). Inputs 16px with proper `inputMode`/`autoComplete`/`enterKeyHint`. `motion-safe:` for animation.
- `cn` from `@/lib/utils` only. Keep focus rings. lucide icons sized with Tailwind. Deletes via `DeleteConfirmDialog`; toasts, `Empty`, `Skeleton`. Nonce CSP: no inline scripts.